/**
 * work-driver-verify-always-run — #1647: the smoke tests that run on EVERY
 * develop verify, whatever the diff touched.
 *
 * A test that reads repository source or configuration AS TEXT depends on files
 * no import graph shows, so a selection built from imports would never run it
 * for a change to the file it reads. The list is enumerated, not inferred at run
 * time, so an entry that goes missing is a reviewable diff. It is generated by
 * `smoke-tests/lib/always-run-detector.ts` (`bun … --write`), and the completeness
 * smoke test (`test-verify-select-always-run.ts`) fails when a reader is missing.
 *
 * Paths are relative to `extension/`. Live tests are never listed: they never
 * run offline.
 */

